WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:01.280
All right, let's continue.

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.360
We have so much to discuss and so much to
cover.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:13.179
There is a very, very notable breaking news
that there are cabinet members actually discussing,

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:16.369
invoking the 25th Amendment to remove Donald
Trump from office.

00:00:16.369 --> 00:00:20.550
Now, the fact that they're considering it
is the story.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.330
I don't believe it will happen.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:27.460
I think ultimately it's going to be a lot
of well, if I supported it, would you supported

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.369
it if the two of us did?

00:00:29.369 --> 00:00:30.670
What about you?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.470
Will would Pence go for it?

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:38.400
But the 25th Amendment, I don't believe, ultimately
will be invoked, but it is being discussed.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.750
CNN reporting that there are cabinet members
holding preliminary discussions about invoking

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:48.600
the 25th Amendment to force Donald Trump to
leave office early.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:53.770
And it is unclear whether there will be enough
cabinet members in favor to result in Donald

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:55.420
Trump's removal.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:01:01.370
But this has now been widely reported by CNN,
The Hill and numerous other outlets.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:06.720
It is abundantly clear that the conversation
is happening in light of the violent riots

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.830
that were fomented yesterday by Donald Trump.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:15.850
House Judiciary Democrats have also written
a letter to Mike Pence asking him to invoke

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:20.030
the 25th Amendment, although I don't believe
there's it.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:24.970
If it happens or if it's being seriously considered,
it's not because Democrats are asking for

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:25.970
it.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:31.980
But Congressman David Cicilline did write
a letter in which he says, Dear Vice President

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.720
Pence, it is with great sadness that we write
to you following the incidents that unfolded

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:44.570
where he goes on to, say, Section four of
the 25th Amendment to the Constitution provides

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:49.799
the vice president and majority of sitting
cabinet secretaries with the authority to

00:01:49.799 --> 00:01:55.750
determine a president as unfit if they are
unable to discharge the powers and duties

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:57.510
of the office.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:02.560
Going on to say for the sake of democracy,
we emphatically urge you to invoke the 25th

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:07.760
Amendment and begin the process of removing
President Trump from power.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.239
Obviously, Donald Trump should be removed
from power.

00:02:11.239 --> 00:02:13.810
Obviously, Donald Trump should have already
been impeached.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.670
The Georgia phone call was an impeachable
offense.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:17.840
There have been other impeachable offenses.

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.069
We could go back to talk about Saudi Arabia
and Yemen.

00:02:20.069 --> 00:02:25.349
I mean, it's we're going back quite a way
when we are now just 13 days from the end,

00:02:25.349 --> 00:02:27.599
one way or another.

00:02:27.599 --> 00:02:30.069
I don't believe that this will happen.

00:02:30.069 --> 00:02:33.379
And I think it's also important to say one
one other thing about this.

00:02:33.379 --> 00:02:38.690
We'll be talking a little bit later about
Republicans now who are bailing on Donald

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.739
Trump there.

00:02:41.739 --> 00:02:43.450
They're done in 13 days.

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:51.019
The idea that now they are being brave and
defiant and moral and upstanding guys.

00:02:51.019 --> 00:02:53.060
There's 13 days left.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.840
If you want to point to anyone.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:03.069
I mean, listen, John McCain from the beginning
was I'm not a big McCain guy.

00:03:03.069 --> 00:03:06.760
But from the beginning, McCain said what he
believed.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.599
He didn't wait until there was no political
risk.

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:17.019
Mitt Romney, his opposition to Trump is quite
milquetoast, but it's been consistent after

00:03:17.019 --> 00:03:21.730
he had that weird frog leg lunch with with
Trump, where it seemed like maybe he could

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.329
be Trump's secretary of state.

00:03:23.329 --> 00:03:26.650
But it's been years that at least Mitt Romney
has been consistent.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.249
And it's not like a big deal.

00:03:28.249 --> 00:03:34.209
He's mildly critical of Donald Trump in most
cases with a few more serious critiques.

00:03:34.209 --> 00:03:38.489
But he was exposed to the downsides of doing
it for years.

00:03:38.489 --> 00:03:43.980
These people now who in the middle of the
night last night when everybody had already

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:49.870
mostly tuned out, came and said, you know,
listen, our role here is just to count.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.099
And that's what we have to do.

00:03:51.099 --> 00:03:55.069
There's nothing else we can do or some of
the resignations that are taking place now,

00:03:55.069 --> 00:03:58.799
including like from Mick Mulvaney, who who
even remembered that Mulvaney was still even

00:03:58.799 --> 00:04:01.299
working for the Trump White House.

00:04:01.299 --> 00:04:03.269
This is it's too little, too late.

00:04:03.269 --> 00:04:08.079
And we can't now put them back on the good
boys list as a result of them doing this.

00:04:08.079 --> 00:04:10.079
That's very important to keep in mind.

00:04:10.079 --> 00:04:15.609
Again, the big story is the mere fact that
the use of the 25th Amendment is being considered

00:04:15.609 --> 00:04:18.139
is absolutely insane.

00:04:18.139 --> 00:04:19.780
It should be used.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:23.270
There are mental health professionals like
Dr. Bandele, who we've interviewed who are

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:28.620
now asking for a 72 hour psych hold for Donald
Trump.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:35.930
Most of this stuff is merely symbolic, but
the fact that it's taking place really confirms

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:39.440
the dystopian reality in which we are living.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:44.270
And then also importantly, and we'll talk
about this next, Donald Trump has agreed to

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.530
